WEBVTT

01:42.480 --> 01:43.320
General.

01:44.160 --> 01:45.080
The man is here.

01:46.920 --> 01:49.360
Do you have parents or brothers at home?

01:50.440 --> 01:53.000
Do you have any relatives
or friends in your hometown?

01:53.640 --> 01:55.920
General. I am an orphan.

02:01.600 --> 02:02.560
Come.

02:04.440 --> 02:05.280
Come up.

02:14.240 --> 02:16.840
Forget your past and your name.

02:17.600 --> 02:19.080
Remember every word I say.

02:20.040 --> 02:21.760
Your surname is actually Xiao.

02:21.840 --> 02:24.520
A child of the Xiao imperial bloodline
who has been lost outside.

02:24.600 --> 02:27.080
The late emperor once ordered me
to bring you back.

02:28.080 --> 02:29.320
I searched for years.

02:29.400 --> 02:31.440
At last, you may return
to the rightful lineage.

02:32.040 --> 02:34.400
The throne now stands empty.

02:34.480 --> 02:36.320
Chang'an cannot go a single day
without an emperor.

02:36.920 --> 02:40.200
Among the Xiao clan,
you are the only one left.

02:40.800 --> 02:41.840
From this moment on,

02:41.920 --> 02:44.280
you are the emperor of this land.

02:45.320 --> 02:46.560
Is that true?

02:47.280 --> 02:49.240
Of course it is not.

02:51.400 --> 02:52.760
But if I say it is true,

02:53.520 --> 02:54.360
then it is true.

02:56.360 --> 02:57.600
Zhiying.

02:57.680 --> 02:59.280
Dress him in the dragon robe.

02:59.360 --> 03:01.120
See whether it fits or not.

03:01.200 --> 03:02.040
Yes.

03:06.360 --> 03:07.600
Come with me.

03:31.280 --> 03:33.000
AWAKENING AND RETURNING TO PURITY

03:33.080 --> 03:34.440
Do you know

03:36.440 --> 03:38.440
you and I met when we were very young?

03:42.360 --> 03:44.040
It was about 19 years ago.

03:45.640 --> 03:46.920
Yan Fengshan

03:48.120 --> 03:49.440
had not yet turned traitor.

03:50.920 --> 03:53.160
He was cold, cruel,

03:53.880 --> 03:55.200
and not like he is now,

03:56.560 --> 03:58.400
still able to put on a guise of kindness.

04:01.760 --> 04:02.880
At that time,

04:04.160 --> 04:05.720
he adopted a child.

04:07.360 --> 04:09.200
The child came from the northern border.

04:09.960 --> 04:11.040
He had no parents.

04:11.720 --> 04:12.840
Back then,

04:15.480 --> 04:16.399
I saw you.

04:17.600 --> 04:21.600
Back then, your eyes
always looked to the horizon.

04:21.680 --> 04:23.280
Unlike how they are now.

04:24.040 --> 04:26.920
What about me now?

04:27.000 --> 04:28.360
The way you are now,

04:31.600 --> 04:33.320
your eyes see only what's before you.

04:35.000 --> 04:36.000
A man like that

04:38.000 --> 04:39.080
easily grows obsessed.

04:50.000 --> 04:51.520
You asked what tricks I have.

04:52.480 --> 04:53.400
I have none.

04:54.520 --> 04:56.240
You people are the ones
who control Chang'an.

04:58.040 --> 05:01.160
But I do have a tale I wish to tell you.

05:02.200 --> 05:06.200
It is about your origins
and Yan Fengshan's past.

05:08.760 --> 05:10.240
How many dumplings will you have?

05:30.680 --> 05:33.240
HOUSE SAUCES, SWEETS

05:38.240 --> 05:41.680
Your origins are exactly so.

05:42.760 --> 05:44.080
How you choose

05:45.240 --> 05:46.680
is entirely up to you.

05:48.160 --> 05:49.160
How

05:50.960 --> 05:52.640
can I choose?

05:54.840 --> 05:58.080
To avenge your blood kin is only right.

05:59.160 --> 06:00.600
Let the past 20 years

06:02.880 --> 06:04.560
be treated as no more than a dream.

06:06.200 --> 06:07.840
If you carry out this task,

06:07.920 --> 06:09.560
you may live for six more hours.

06:10.080 --> 06:13.000
If you refuse,
Commander Wang is right outside the door.

06:13.520 --> 06:15.400
He hides his skill deep within.

06:15.480 --> 06:16.920
His blade is the same.

06:17.800 --> 06:21.200
If you cannot pass that door,
you will die here all the same.

06:26.240 --> 06:31.240
AWAKENING AND RETURNING TO PURITY

06:31.320 --> 06:32.400
Xie Huai'an.

06:34.680 --> 06:35.920
Living your whole life this way,

06:38.000 --> 06:39.320
aren't you tired?

06:40.000 --> 06:41.200
What you should ask me

06:42.400 --> 06:44.080
is whether it is right to live this way.

06:44.960 --> 06:46.480
I once believed I was right.

06:46.560 --> 06:49.080
You killed far too many
who should not have died.

06:50.520 --> 06:52.120
I will never let you win.

06:53.600 --> 06:54.880
Whatever you intend to do,

06:56.400 --> 06:58.520
I will never let you succeed.

07:03.240 --> 07:05.480
Do you want to see
Yan Fengshan die with your own eyes?

07:11.280 --> 07:12.400
Nothing would please me more.

07:13.720 --> 07:14.560
My thanks.

07:34.280 --> 07:37.080
Bamboo baskets.

07:37.160 --> 07:38.320
Pork.

07:39.040 --> 07:41.960
All of it is top-quality pork
slaughtered fresh today.

07:43.720 --> 07:45.640
Sir, what would you like?

07:46.960 --> 07:49.000
One and a half jin of hind leg meat,

07:50.200 --> 07:51.680
for making dumplings for two people.

07:51.760 --> 07:53.200
All right. One moment.

07:53.280 --> 07:54.200
I'll give you a discount.

07:54.280 --> 07:55.240
Pack them together.

07:58.120 --> 08:00.560
-Sir. Here you go.
-No need.

08:45.760 --> 08:46.760
You are back, General.

08:47.400 --> 08:48.640
I haven't cooked for you in ages.

08:48.720 --> 08:51.480
I shall practice today,
so I do not get rusty.

09:02.000 --> 09:04.360
The people you assigned
to keep an eye on me

09:04.440 --> 09:05.680
have already been eliminated.

09:07.800 --> 09:09.600
I know. But I did not bother with it.

09:11.640 --> 09:12.760
Xie Huai'an

09:13.720 --> 09:14.560
is laying a trap for me.

09:14.640 --> 09:15.680
That is fine.

09:16.320 --> 09:17.520
I wanted to meet him anyway.

09:18.760 --> 09:19.600
I figured as much.

09:20.480 --> 09:22.640
White Hair is a ruthless man.

09:22.720 --> 09:24.600
For you to return alive

09:25.880 --> 09:26.880
is no small feat.

09:30.200 --> 09:31.840
But I feel he has no tricks left.

09:35.320 --> 09:36.960
He only told me

09:38.320 --> 09:39.720
a piece of the past,

09:40.440 --> 09:41.680
something about my origins.

09:43.560 --> 09:44.800
Then he let me go.

09:45.920 --> 09:46.840
He even asked me

09:46.920 --> 09:49.080
whether I was willing
to make dumplings for you.

09:50.760 --> 09:52.240
The dumplings are cooked,

09:52.320 --> 09:54.080
General, do not eat yet.

09:55.600 --> 09:56.480
In strategy,

09:57.000 --> 09:58.280
I am no match for Xie Huai'an.

09:59.600 --> 10:01.360
But I am not foolish enough

10:02.080 --> 10:03.480
to let a piece of the past

10:04.520 --> 10:06.920
erase the years I have spent
following you.

10:11.320 --> 10:12.680
I waited for you here,

10:14.480 --> 10:15.840
simply to ask for clarity.

10:19.200 --> 10:22.840
I never spoke of the past to you
not because I did not want you to know,

10:24.760 --> 10:27.000
but because I did not want
to remember it myself.

10:28.000 --> 10:29.200
Since matters have come to this,

10:30.400 --> 10:31.960
I shall tell you.

10:33.600 --> 10:36.320
Twenty-five years ago,
in the northern borderlands,

10:36.400 --> 10:39.440
there was a place called Chen Valley.

10:42.040 --> 10:43.680
We called it Chen Valley,

10:44.200 --> 10:47.920
but the Tiemo people called that place
Mingshanzi Gorge.

10:48.440 --> 10:49.840
A tiny patch of land,

10:50.880 --> 10:54.160
yet we and the Tiemo people
fought over it seven times.

10:54.240 --> 10:56.480
In the final battle, we lost.

10:57.520 --> 10:59.320
My soldiers and I were captured

11:00.200 --> 11:02.600
and locked inside
the Tiemo army's granary,

11:02.680 --> 11:04.320
waiting quietly for death.

11:25.960 --> 11:28.160
The Tiemo people were toying
with the prisoners.

11:28.760 --> 11:31.040
Each time they lowered the food,
there was less than before.

11:32.600 --> 11:36.120
The last time,
they dropped only one steamed bun…

11:46.600 --> 11:48.080
and one knife.

12:19.640 --> 12:21.520
It seemed only I understood

12:22.320 --> 12:24.920
that no matter how much food
the Tiemo people gave us,

12:25.920 --> 12:28.840
none of us would survive
until the day they opened the granary.

12:31.200 --> 12:33.840
Unless the Tiemo people
believed we were all dead.

12:39.960 --> 12:43.640
So I killed every last one of them.

13:26.640 --> 13:30.040
After that, many more days passed.

13:39.960 --> 13:42.240
After I killed all the Tiemo people,

13:42.320 --> 13:44.520
I wandered across the wasteland
for a long time.

13:45.840 --> 13:48.520
At that time, I felt like a ghost,

13:48.600 --> 13:50.800
not knowing where I should go,

13:50.880 --> 13:53.560
not knowing
whether I even deserved to live.

13:55.280 --> 13:57.040
I walked for a very long time.

13:57.120 --> 13:59.560
At last, I returned to my own land.

13:59.640 --> 14:01.840
A farming couple took me in.

14:02.560 --> 14:03.960
They were not afraid of me.

14:04.040 --> 14:05.960
Instead they gave me a bowl of hot rice.

14:06.040 --> 14:08.720
Here, sir, do not be shy. Eat quickly.

14:09.480 --> 14:10.600
Treat this as your own home.

14:12.080 --> 14:14.000
Yes, sir, I still have some meat here.

14:14.080 --> 14:15.200
It will be ready soon.

14:17.840 --> 14:19.840
Go on, eat. There is more in the pot.

14:24.240 --> 14:25.680
At that time,

14:25.760 --> 14:27.600
or perhaps for many years after,

14:28.120 --> 14:30.600
I had not truly stepped out
of that granary.

14:31.680 --> 14:34.760
I believed that only by killing everyone

14:34.840 --> 14:36.640
could I earn a single meal.

15:01.680 --> 15:03.280
That child was you.

15:09.680 --> 15:12.560
This story, is it the same
as the one White Hair told you?

15:18.360 --> 15:20.280
If I had died in that granary,

15:20.360 --> 15:22.640
or if your parents had not taken me in,

15:22.720 --> 15:25.640
you would never have become a member
of the Huben Army.

15:26.480 --> 15:30.000
The village where you were born
stood on a sunny hillside.

15:30.080 --> 15:31.680
You could have been a farmer,

15:31.760 --> 15:35.120
and after a day of work,
you could still go home to eat dumplings,

15:35.200 --> 15:38.160
with your parents not yet old
sitting beside you.

15:39.360 --> 15:41.360
Such a life would have been blessed.

15:42.960 --> 15:44.400
But because of me,

15:45.280 --> 15:47.040
your entire life changed.

15:50.160 --> 15:51.000
So

15:51.600 --> 15:55.280
today White Hair used you
in an attempt to poison me.

15:57.240 --> 16:00.440
To avenge my blood kin is only just.

16:01.360 --> 16:02.680
Let the past 20 years

16:03.720 --> 16:05.160
be treated as a dream.

16:13.280 --> 16:14.600
I do not blame you.

17:06.800 --> 17:08.040
When I was seven,

17:09.160 --> 17:10.599
I learned how to make dumplings.

17:11.440 --> 17:12.880
I even wrapped

17:14.839 --> 17:15.839
a copper coin inside one.

17:16.920 --> 17:18.400
I had hoped you would take it,

17:20.880 --> 17:22.440
and with it I wished you long life,

17:22.960 --> 17:24.599
in peace and in safety.

17:38.120 --> 17:40.040
Xie Huai'an even tried to sway me,

17:41.080 --> 17:43.920
hoping I would come back and poison you.

17:45.120 --> 17:46.600
How could that ever happen?

17:50.200 --> 17:53.080
If not you, how would I be who I am today?

17:56.720 --> 17:58.400
As for those parents,

18:00.560 --> 18:01.800
I never laid eyes on them,

18:03.200 --> 18:04.560
not even for a single day.

18:04.640 --> 18:06.520
Their deaths mean nothing to me.

18:07.880 --> 18:10.520
All these years, the one who raised me

18:13.920 --> 18:15.520
was the General of the Huben Army,

18:17.400 --> 18:18.480
Yan Fengshan.

18:28.360 --> 18:30.080
He wants to watch you die
with his own eyes.

18:31.920 --> 18:33.240
He entered the city with me.

18:44.920 --> 18:45.760
Stop.

18:46.680 --> 18:47.720
-Come here.
-Move these things out.

18:50.680 --> 18:53.000
-Do you have a travel pass?
-Yes.

18:54.560 --> 18:56.680
From Huai'an Commandery.
My surname is Zeng.

19:00.520 --> 19:02.360
-Go on.
-Thank you.

19:04.840 --> 19:07.880
Only three watchtowers nearby
have a view of this courtyard.

19:08.960 --> 19:10.200
A man wearing a fisherman's hat,

19:10.720 --> 19:12.240
with half his face covered,

19:12.760 --> 19:14.480
and a fish maw mask on his upper face,

19:16.080 --> 19:17.360
that is Xie Huai'an.

19:27.080 --> 19:28.560
Before you returned,

19:29.320 --> 19:31.560
I had already sent Zhiying
to hunt him down.

19:32.840 --> 19:33.960
This

19:35.120 --> 19:36.680
is the final plan

19:38.760 --> 19:39.760
I offer to you.

20:08.120 --> 20:09.600
The past

20:11.280 --> 20:12.320
has nothing to do with me.

20:13.720 --> 20:14.960
In this life,

20:15.800 --> 20:16.960
I have no regrets.

20:17.480 --> 20:22.080
To die with a father not yet old
beside me,

20:23.080 --> 20:24.480
that is a fine life.

21:06.440 --> 21:08.480
May you live a thousand years

21:11.280 --> 21:12.320
in peace

21:13.320 --> 21:14.320
and safety.

21:50.360 --> 21:53.120
Wang Pu, you are truly foolish.

21:53.640 --> 21:58.400
A man like White Hair would never believe
you would poison me.

21:59.000 --> 22:00.960
He merely wanted you to return to my side,

22:01.040 --> 22:03.640
so that I could watch you die
with my own eyes.

22:26.240 --> 22:27.080
General.

22:28.040 --> 22:31.120
The man wearing the fish maw mask
was not Xie Huai'an at all.

23:04.040 --> 23:05.640
Hold your tongue.

23:07.680 --> 23:10.040
We have known each other
for quite some time.

23:11.960 --> 23:13.640
Yet I still failed
to see your true nature.

23:15.800 --> 23:18.960
You would sell out the loyal and upright
and even abet villains

23:20.000 --> 23:21.280
for money.

23:22.440 --> 23:25.240
No wonder this temple has so few devotees.

23:27.320 --> 23:28.840
It is not the location.

23:33.040 --> 23:34.520
It is your wicked heart.

23:39.640 --> 23:41.160
How shall we deal with him?

23:41.240 --> 23:42.840
Mister, spare me. Sir, spare me.

23:42.920 --> 23:43.920
Sir, spare me.

23:45.920 --> 23:46.760
Please stand.

23:49.680 --> 23:51.880
I am but a wanted man.

23:52.840 --> 23:53.880
Your life

23:54.880 --> 23:56.520
is not mine to spare.

24:00.840 --> 24:02.840
You knew my identity long ago.

24:03.440 --> 24:05.080
You waited and observed for a month,

24:05.160 --> 24:06.960
and only when you thought I had gone mad

24:07.720 --> 24:08.640
did you report me.

24:10.120 --> 24:11.960
To have such careful judgment,

24:12.640 --> 24:13.600
sir,

24:14.120 --> 24:16.240
why waste it on a gambling table?

24:18.480 --> 24:19.600
I, Xie Huai'an,

24:20.600 --> 24:21.640
thank you

24:22.720 --> 24:24.080
for taking me in during this time.

24:26.560 --> 24:27.400
Thank you, sir.

24:27.480 --> 24:28.840
Thank you for sparing my life.

24:28.920 --> 24:30.400
-Thank you for sparing my life.
-Go.

24:32.160 --> 24:33.760
Go.

24:41.200 --> 24:43.040
-Commander Wang.
-Here.

24:43.680 --> 24:45.000
Return to the Capital.

24:46.120 --> 24:47.920
Prepare to gather all available men
in the Capital.

24:48.000 --> 24:49.240
Yes.

24:49.320 --> 24:51.640
The Tiemo secret envoy
has already set off.

24:53.120 --> 24:54.960
This is our chance to strike back.

24:55.760 --> 24:58.680
For this day,
I have waited a long time too.

25:00.640 --> 25:01.960
I await your command.

25:14.120 --> 25:15.080
Mr. Long.

25:19.160 --> 25:20.600
You did not visit before,

25:21.120 --> 25:22.200
nor did you send a letter.

25:22.920 --> 25:25.400
There are many people worried about you.

25:27.320 --> 25:28.760
I was watched too closely this time,

25:29.280 --> 25:30.720
so I dared not write rashly.

25:31.240 --> 25:32.240
Please forgive me, Mr. Long.

25:34.040 --> 25:34.960
Come.

25:35.680 --> 25:38.800
I will take you to see
the place your father left behind.

26:17.240 --> 26:18.200
Look here.

26:18.280 --> 26:19.600
I even added a bit more for you.

26:19.680 --> 26:21.120
How is it enough?

26:21.200 --> 26:22.080
Enough.

26:22.160 --> 26:24.240
-That will be seven wen in total.
-All right.

26:24.320 --> 26:26.520
-I packed it for you.
-All right.

26:48.000 --> 26:49.000
All right then.

26:49.880 --> 26:50.960
Here you go.

26:51.040 --> 26:52.360
-Count it.
-Thank you.

27:28.720 --> 27:30.360
You finally showed up.

27:32.200 --> 27:33.680
What? Did you think I died?

27:33.760 --> 27:35.840
No, no.

27:37.480 --> 27:38.440
Sir,

27:38.520 --> 27:40.200
I have something to attend to…

27:44.040 --> 27:45.120
Come.

28:00.680 --> 28:01.520
Well?

28:02.200 --> 28:03.680
This place is nice, isn't it?

28:04.720 --> 28:07.360
You will never see
scenery like this in Chang'an.

28:07.440 --> 28:09.240
It is practically a paradise.

28:10.320 --> 28:13.120
But this paradise has one flaw.

28:13.200 --> 28:14.640
There is no sunlight.

28:14.720 --> 28:16.680
Without sunlight, there are no crops.

28:16.760 --> 28:18.880
So rice is more expensive than salt here.

28:19.760 --> 28:22.680
Right. This paradise has another flaw.

28:23.200 --> 28:25.600
You cannot see the sun,
so you cannot tell the time.

28:25.680 --> 28:29.400
Rising with the sun and resting at sunset
is impossible here.

28:30.840 --> 28:32.200
The salt shop where you work

28:32.280 --> 28:33.880
has a salt hourglass for time, doesn't it?

28:36.040 --> 28:36.880
How do you know that?

28:37.480 --> 28:40.440
And the shops along the street
also have hourglasses for timing.

28:41.520 --> 28:42.680
You know that too?

28:42.760 --> 28:43.920
Have you been here before?

28:44.000 --> 28:46.960
Using hourglasses to keep time
was an assignment from Mr. Wu Zhongheng

28:47.040 --> 28:48.920
back when we were at the Grand Academy.

28:49.000 --> 28:50.840
If I remember correctly,

28:50.920 --> 28:53.640
you pretended to be sick
and never handed in your work.

28:56.400 --> 28:58.280
And you…

28:58.800 --> 28:59.640
Still pretending?

29:00.240 --> 29:03.160
The hourglass in your shop
is the result of my assignment.

29:04.640 --> 29:05.880
My father originally

29:06.480 --> 29:08.480
designed this Cangshui River

29:08.560 --> 29:10.120
because there was no daylight here,

29:10.880 --> 29:12.440
which was why he moved everything inside.

29:13.160 --> 29:16.000
Since there is me, why must there be you?

29:19.360 --> 29:21.200
-Zheng.
-Look who is here.

29:24.320 --> 29:25.400
Who else could it be?

29:25.480 --> 29:27.160
Isn't that Xie Huai'an?

29:28.080 --> 29:29.480
Why are you so cold?

29:30.120 --> 29:31.240
It has been a long time.

29:32.680 --> 29:33.640
I know.

29:35.160 --> 29:36.800
It is because he came to see me first,

29:36.880 --> 29:37.840
is that right?

29:40.640 --> 29:42.880
Thank you for going to the trouble.
We just met.

29:43.640 --> 29:44.560
Yet we spoke of strategy.

29:44.640 --> 29:46.040
Do you want to hear the plan?

29:46.120 --> 29:47.400
Come with me.

29:47.480 --> 29:48.960
I will tell you slowly.

29:50.000 --> 29:51.360
Little one.

29:51.440 --> 29:53.040
No. When did you ever talk about strategy?

29:53.720 --> 29:56.000
-You're the little one.
-Little Mo.

29:56.080 --> 29:57.080
Get lost.

30:03.040 --> 30:05.080
Chang'an is now sealed tight.

30:05.600 --> 30:07.920
Yan Fengshan and the Huben Army
control everything.

30:09.160 --> 30:11.160
But the civil court is still running,

30:12.440 --> 30:15.840
so the people of Chang'an
have not been pushed to outrage.

30:16.600 --> 30:18.400
The troops of Xiao Wuyang outside the city

30:18.480 --> 30:21.160
are surrounded by
the four regional military commanders.

30:21.240 --> 30:22.920
But they have not cut off supplies.

30:23.720 --> 30:27.120
Otherwise the Wuyang Army
would fight to the last.

30:27.200 --> 30:29.480
Yan Fengshan is truly capable.

30:30.120 --> 30:32.520
He restrains the troops
without provoking war,

30:33.120 --> 30:35.840
and controls the city
without stirring public anger.

30:37.320 --> 30:38.480
If you ask me,

30:39.000 --> 30:42.280
he is so capable,
he might as well make himself emperor.

30:44.360 --> 30:46.320
He has held power for years,

30:46.400 --> 30:49.040
and the people of Chang'an are used to it.

30:49.640 --> 30:52.920
Now, he props up a fake emperor
to keep things calm.

30:53.520 --> 30:55.440
If he suddenly declared himself emperor,

30:56.040 --> 30:58.200
it would not benefit him at all.

30:58.920 --> 31:02.080
He can still weigh the scales properly.

31:03.480 --> 31:05.400
Isn't there a large army in the north?

31:05.480 --> 31:06.400
The Baiwenhu main force.

31:06.480 --> 31:08.360
The northern Baiwenhu Army.

31:09.080 --> 31:10.600
They will not march south unless summoned.

31:11.560 --> 31:12.720
This was once

31:13.400 --> 31:15.080
my father's pact with the Gu family.

31:16.560 --> 31:18.800
So when my brother attacked Chang'an
back then,

31:19.560 --> 31:21.920
Gu Yu only brought 1,000 personal guards.

31:22.000 --> 31:23.120
But look at the situation now.

31:27.880 --> 31:28.880
Xie Huai'an,

31:29.920 --> 31:31.920
if you need an imperial summons

31:33.040 --> 31:34.080
I can give it to you.

31:36.680 --> 31:38.400
With the situation as it is,

31:38.480 --> 31:41.160
even if you wrote me an imperial edict
to summon them,

31:41.240 --> 31:42.880
I would have no way
to send it to the north.

31:42.960 --> 31:44.920
If we acted now,

31:45.520 --> 31:48.960
your identity would be exposed
and everything would collapse.

31:50.000 --> 31:51.960
Yan Fengshan is colluding
with the Tiemo people.

31:53.000 --> 31:55.040
The Tiemo have stationed

31:55.120 --> 31:57.840
a massive army in the northern borderlands
to deal with the Baiwenhu Army.

31:59.040 --> 32:00.920
If the Baiwenhu Army marched south,

32:01.640 --> 32:03.400
the entire heartland of the empire

32:04.240 --> 32:05.600
would be opened to the Tiemo.

32:06.200 --> 32:10.120
Yan Fengshan is deeply entangled with
the Tiemo.

32:11.720 --> 32:12.840
So next,

32:13.880 --> 32:15.000
how should we take him down?

32:15.880 --> 32:18.560
The Tiemo people and Yan Fengshan

32:19.440 --> 32:21.040
are not perfectly united.

32:21.880 --> 32:23.880
Now that the Tiemo envoy has come south,

32:24.480 --> 32:27.480
he is heading to Chang'an
to negotiate with Yan Fengshan.

32:27.560 --> 32:29.640
This is our best chance.

32:30.720 --> 32:31.640
I guess

32:32.360 --> 32:34.320
Yan Fengshan will first cede land

32:34.840 --> 32:36.160
in the far north

32:37.680 --> 32:38.600
and use it

32:39.800 --> 32:41.120
to bribe the Tiemo people

32:42.080 --> 32:44.040
in exchange for their attack
on the Baiwenhu Army.

32:45.000 --> 32:46.600
Once the Baiwenhu Army is defeated,

32:47.200 --> 32:50.200
there will be no army left
to stand against Yan Fengshan.

33:02.440 --> 33:03.320
Gu Yu.

33:06.080 --> 33:07.000
Is Gu Yu still alive?

33:08.120 --> 33:09.720
If he is,

33:09.800 --> 33:11.680
you must send him to the north at once,

33:11.760 --> 33:15.240
because only then will the Tiemo people
fail to defeat the Baiwenhu Army.

33:16.120 --> 33:17.360
As to Gu Yu's life or death,

33:19.440 --> 33:20.440
I am not certain.

33:27.200 --> 33:28.200
And your brother?

33:35.000 --> 33:36.320
Mr. Long says he can wake up,

33:37.520 --> 33:38.960
but no one knows when.

34:59.960 --> 35:03.320
How did you know I was awake?

35:03.400 --> 35:04.960
I could see it.

35:06.640 --> 35:08.120
I just could not guess

35:08.960 --> 35:10.600
why you pretended to be unconscious.

35:11.720 --> 35:12.880
I was not pretending.

35:15.200 --> 35:16.240
Each day

35:17.520 --> 35:19.360
I am only awake for a brief moment.

35:25.080 --> 35:26.720
It feels like being in a dream,
doesn't it?

35:28.040 --> 35:28.960
In the dream

35:30.000 --> 35:32.160
it was the road
you had never wanted to take.

35:33.360 --> 35:34.760
A brush with death,

35:37.360 --> 35:38.240
I've been there too.

35:40.120 --> 35:42.320
A long palace corridor.

35:43.760 --> 35:46.600
Gu Yu and the Baiwenhu Army

35:47.960 --> 35:51.080
pushed me out the door

35:52.600 --> 35:54.280
and got farther and farther away from me.

35:55.080 --> 35:56.960
The path by which I survived

35:57.560 --> 35:59.000
was the path

36:00.160 --> 36:01.680
I least wished to walk in my life.

36:05.120 --> 36:06.440
Wumei once told me

36:07.520 --> 36:09.280
that back then you were one step

36:10.960 --> 36:12.200
from death.

36:14.000 --> 36:15.000
I do not blame you.

36:19.560 --> 36:20.680
So

36:21.760 --> 36:23.320
Xiao Wuyang

36:24.600 --> 36:26.280
can die after all.

36:30.120 --> 36:31.080
White Hair.

36:32.960 --> 36:36.160
If one day I truly die,

36:37.240 --> 36:39.600
will you, like your forefathers,

36:41.360 --> 36:42.920
support the imperial clan?

36:56.400 --> 36:57.440
I know

36:59.400 --> 37:01.080
that is not where your ambition lies.

37:02.480 --> 37:04.320
But you must care for the realm.

37:05.360 --> 37:08.000
Heaven has given you such wisdom.

37:08.840 --> 37:10.080
You must use it

37:11.080 --> 37:12.320
to serve all the people.

37:18.840 --> 37:20.040
But my father

37:22.120 --> 37:23.800
once did exactly that.

37:34.520 --> 37:35.920
And you must not die either.

37:36.520 --> 37:38.640
Heaven has given you such skill,

37:39.280 --> 37:40.600
and you too

37:41.720 --> 37:43.200
should give back to all the people.

37:48.760 --> 37:50.000
I will not.

37:52.480 --> 37:54.640
Before Yan Fengshan dies,

37:56.240 --> 37:57.840
I, Xiao Wuyang,

37:58.640 --> 37:59.920
will not die.

38:01.640 --> 38:05.400
Do not tell anyone
that I wake for brief moments

38:05.480 --> 38:07.200
each day,

38:07.960 --> 38:09.040
including

38:11.120 --> 38:12.720
your pageboy outside the door.

38:34.880 --> 38:37.200
Why did you stay in there
for so long before coming out?

38:38.080 --> 38:39.240
Did my brother wake up?

38:45.520 --> 38:46.360
I just figured out…

38:46.440 --> 38:48.000
You'd figured out how to deal with them?

38:50.800 --> 38:51.840
Once the Tiemo envoy

38:52.880 --> 38:54.000
enters Chang'an,

38:54.600 --> 38:57.160
I will make him disappear
for one night right under Huben's nose.

38:58.240 --> 38:59.200
During that night,

38:59.800 --> 39:00.640
you will meet with him.

39:01.960 --> 39:02.800
Me?

39:02.880 --> 39:04.640
If Yan Fengshan and the Tiemo
can negotiate,

39:05.160 --> 39:06.320
why can't you?

39:08.640 --> 39:09.880
Do not forget.

39:13.040 --> 39:14.040
You are the Emperor.

39:31.840 --> 39:33.080
The detailed plan

39:33.160 --> 39:35.840
will be given to you
after you enter Chang'an.

39:41.760 --> 39:42.640
What?

39:43.600 --> 39:44.720
Are you scared?

39:44.800 --> 39:45.880
When the nation is in peril,

39:46.480 --> 39:48.160
even common folk have a duty.

39:48.760 --> 39:49.960
How could I not?

39:51.760 --> 39:52.600
I am not afraid.

39:53.720 --> 39:54.760
You have improved.

39:56.200 --> 39:59.120
Huai'an, we just met again.

39:59.200 --> 40:00.440
Must we leave so soon?

40:00.520 --> 40:01.720
Can't you rest for one night?

40:06.640 --> 40:07.880
Gu Yu's life is uncertain.

40:09.000 --> 40:10.360
I must go and find the truth.

40:12.080 --> 40:15.120
There are other arrangements in the city
that cannot be delayed.

40:24.520 --> 40:25.520
Take these.

40:26.360 --> 40:29.320
You need money to buy medicine and salt.

40:29.400 --> 40:30.920
Stop stealing the shopkeeper's salt.

40:34.920 --> 40:36.600
That salt shopkeeper is a good man.

40:36.680 --> 40:39.920
His scale gives 16.5 liang to a jin.

40:41.000 --> 40:42.720
He says it's to help those in need.

40:44.040 --> 40:45.560
And now I too am someone in hardship.

40:47.520 --> 40:49.880
But once life gets better,

40:49.960 --> 40:50.880
I'll repay him someday.

40:54.040 --> 40:54.880
All right.

40:55.480 --> 40:56.360
I am leaving.

40:56.960 --> 40:57.800
Wait.

41:04.680 --> 41:05.560
Look at the time.

41:06.240 --> 41:07.760
It is already dark outside.

41:07.840 --> 41:10.240
The road back to Chang'an
is long and dark.

41:11.120 --> 41:12.040
Take a lantern.

41:14.280 --> 41:15.240
Take care.

41:19.880 --> 41:21.080
Thanks.

41:23.000 --> 41:24.440
All of you live well.

41:41.320 --> 41:42.240
You are not going back?

41:42.320 --> 41:43.200
No.

41:43.720 --> 41:44.560
I am going for a drink.

41:45.680 --> 41:47.360
-Come on.
-What?

41:49.280 --> 41:50.200
You know,

41:50.960 --> 41:53.520
stealing salt is a job that suits you.

42:17.400 --> 42:18.320
Wuyang,

42:19.680 --> 42:22.880
please have mercy.

42:24.080 --> 42:26.840
Wake quickly, I beg you.

42:26.920 --> 42:28.160
If you wake up,

42:28.680 --> 42:32.280
I won't have to go to that execution trap
Xie Huai'an arranged.

42:32.880 --> 42:36.600
I am begging you. I am really scared.
